From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] airoha-pon: port vendor drivers to Linux 6.18

Modernize the v1 and v2 Kbuild flags and port the EN7581/AN7583 BSP, PHY and
xPON MAC sources to Linux 6.18.  Keep vendor-private packet metadata in skb->cb
and provide compile-time compatibility for SDK interfaces not shipped in the
available source archive.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
